From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kan Zhu <kanzhu@cs.washington.edu>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 16:05:07 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] docs(alignment): rebase the line onto upstream 04730e8 for
 DeepSeek-V4.1

The line now sits on upstream main 04730e82700d0c9b957cda188dd1bbc8073e1fcd
(2026-09-24), the newest main commit with a published cu130 precompiled
wheel that contains vllm/models/deepseek_v41. VLLM_PRECOMPILED_WHEEL_COMMIT
must be that SHA; the saved 8369aff wheel no longer matches.

Also record the routed-experts adaptation to upstream's AuxOutput connector
and the dropped AsyncLLM.profiler commit, now upstream.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
